PitStop AI — Your Career, Accelerated.
An AI-powered career workspace for personalized job outreach, portfolio management, and company research.

---> What It Does
AI Cold Email Generator: Takes a job URL → scrapes job details → extracts requirements → matches relevant portfolio projects → generates a personalized cold email.
Portfolio Manager: Create, view, update, and delete projects with tech stacks and GitHub repositories.
Company Research: Generates structured company/interview intelligence from a company name.
Authentication: Registration, login, protected pages, and token-based request handling.
Database: MySQL + SQLAlchemy for persistent users and portfolio data.

--->  Core AI Workflow
Job URL
  ↓
Web Scraping (WebBaseLoader)
  ↓
Job Information Extraction
  ↓
Portfolio Data (MySQL)
  ↓
Project Relevance Agent
  ↓
Relevant Projects
  ↓
Cold Mail Agent
  ↓
Personalized Email

